---
description: Visual design system for the anniversary invitation
globs: ["app/**/*.tsx", "src/**/*.tsx", "components/**/*.tsx"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Design direction:
- Premium, elegant, and warm
- Inspired by classic anniversary stationery, not generic SaaS UI
- Use generous spacing, soft hierarchy, and refined typography
- Prefer calm visual rhythm over dense layouts
- Use tasteful gold accents because this is a 50th anniversary

Recommended palette:
- Warm ivory or champagne background
- Deep brown, charcoal, or muted wine text
- Soft gold accents
- Optional muted olive, beige, or dusty rose secondary tones

Avoid:
- Neon colors
- Purple/blue AI gradients
- Glassmorphism unless extremely subtle
- Overused generic cards
- Random blob backgrounds
- Excessive shadows
- “Startup landing page” layout patterns

Typography:
- Use an elegant serif for names/headings
- Use a highly readable sans-serif for body text
- Headings should feel ceremonial
- Body text should be comfortable for older guests to read

Use visual details intentionally:
- Thin dividers
- Floral or ornamental accents if tasteful
- Subtle paper texture if implemented cleanly
- Gold linework or border details
- Large, beautiful couple photo if available

Every section should feel like part of one invitation, not separate website blocks.